Consolidation - “May kalayo sa tinda!”: small cartoon fire (not scary): tap firefighter → puts it out;
tap police officer → guides people; tap vendor → reopens the stall, everyone cheers; tap teacher
(review) → brings the class to say salamat. 4 taps.

